                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.2131/24: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Colombia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Dawson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-07-21T18:00:00-05:00">July 21, 1933—6
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 6:55 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>66. Department’s 65, July 20, 6 p.m. With a view to choosing properly equipped
                    advisers Olaya would like memorandum outlining general points Department wishes
                    to discuss. Experts can then be appointed and leave immediately.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dawson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
